      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.65,
      "end_seconds": 12.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "you're alright take a seat what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.67,
      "end_seconds": 18.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.96,
      "end_seconds": 30.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "it's swollen glands in my neck, mostly i kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.08,
      "end_seconds": 37.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.11,
      "end_seconds": 41.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "it's been like this since yesterday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.37,
      "end_seconds": 42.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "ah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.26,
      "end_seconds": 50.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "A very sore throat was there, but it's gone away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.31,
      "end_seconds": 53.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.27,
      "end_seconds": 67.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.95,
      "end_seconds": 88.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 101, BP is 118 over 73, temperature is 39.0 degrees and respiratory rate 20, oxygen saturation is 95 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.46,
      "end_seconds": 92.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.06,
      "end_seconds": 96.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.38,
      "end_seconds": 122.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "your tonsils are large with white coating and the glands in the neck are tender"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.58,
      "end_seconds": 128.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "please sit back down. Any sign of rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.82,
      "end_seconds": 131.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "no. No rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.75,
      "end_seconds": 137.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "and and what about jaundice difficulty breathing or tummy pain on the left?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.82,
      "end_seconds": 146.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "well I haven't had jaundice difficulty breathing or tummy pain on the left no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.3,
      "end_seconds": 150.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.79,
      "end_seconds": 153.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.11,
      "end_seconds": 158.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.87,
      "end_seconds": 165.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I, I had a a triple bypass eight years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.14,
      "end_seconds": 184.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.4,
      "end_seconds": 189.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.19,
      "end_seconds": 192.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.74,
      "end_seconds": 197.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.64,
      "end_seconds": 201.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.65,
      "end_seconds": 207.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.01,
      "end_seconds": 211.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.15,
      "end_seconds": 217.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.47,
      "end_seconds": 221.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.65,
      "end_seconds": 232.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest. So, I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.29,
      "end_seconds": 233.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "ah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.47,
      "end_seconds": 249.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.71,
      "end_seconds": 259.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "I have COPD, for two years i just want to get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.79,
      "end_seconds": 264.61,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "mm-hmm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.29,
      "end_seconds": 269.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I, I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.96,
      "end_seconds": 289.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.0,
      "end_seconds": 294.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.09,
      "end_seconds": 324.56,
      "duration_seconds": 28.47,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It points towards glandular fever. I'll request a monospot test, it'll help with sore throat and fatigue. Let's get a blood count, for glandular fever. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Rest, plenty of fluids, and no contact sport for a month cos of the spleen. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.18,
      "end_seconds": 332.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.03,
      "end_seconds": 340.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Thank you that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.27,
      "end_seconds": 348.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you wanna ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.99,
      "end_seconds": 353.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "no, that's all thanks a lot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.67,
      "end_seconds": 356.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
